  {
   "text": "This means that the seventh or the opposite sign from the sign of exaltation ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    307,
    556,
    322
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of a planet, is the sign of fall or debilitation.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    331,
    331,
    347
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Notes— There is great difference of opinion amongst the ancient learneds ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    355,
    556,
    371
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "about the exaltation and debilitation signs of Rahu and Ketu. Mantreswara has ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    379,
    556,
    395
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "expressed no opinion in that regard. According to Sarvarth Chintamani the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    404,
    556,
    419
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "exaltation sign of Rahu is Gemini and his sign of debilitation is Sagittarius. ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    428,
    556,
    443
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Reverse is the case with Ketu. According to Brihat Parasara Hora Sastra Taurus ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    452,
    556,
    467
   ]
  },
  {
